<title>POLAND: DROSED TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 80.</title>
<headline>DROSED TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 80.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 14,500 shares of Polish poultry producer Drosed SA at 80 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Drosed shares traded at 83.5 zlotys in a volume of 11,800 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48</p>
</text>
